      },
      {
        "text": "People in positions of power are capable of self-reflection and collective action when faced with crisis.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "A sustained reduction in political hostility requires more than emotional reactions to tragedies.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The current level of political rhetoric is harmful and unsustainable.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Audiences expect leaders to respond constructively to national crises.",
